WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.030
Medium Yoga Arch begins the projectile setup.

2
00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:01.730
Dhalsim slides underneath the falling Arch.

3
00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:02.280
Back medium kick connects after the Arch hit.

4
00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.330
OD Yoga Flame launches the opponent.

5
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.180
Standing heavy kick catches the airborne opponent.

6
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:04.480
Light Yoga Fire approaches the opponent after the heavy-kick knockdown.
